# The image needs three things from this directory: the installer, the
# entrypoint, and drivers/. Everything else here is host-side (compose
# overlays, netem.sh, scripts/) or run output, and shipping it to the daemon
# added ~1 GB to every build context.
*
!setup_the_guild_gold_2.0.0.5.exe
!entrypoint.sh
!drivers/
